<title>USA: Prima Energy sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>Prima Energy sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prima Energy Corp Monday said it has approved a three-for-two stock split of its common stock to stockholders of record on February 20, 1997, to be distributed on March 4, 1997.</p>
<p>Based on the number of shares of common stock currently outstanding, 3,860,396 shares, the maximum number of shares of common stock to be outstanding on the distribution date will be 5,790,594 shares.</p>
</text>
